; GaiaLabs Retranslation, chapter 29. Dialogue only.

?INCLUDE 'nvAC_kara'
nvAC_kara.dialogstring_0881E2! `[CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: The tropics are[N]amazingly hot[AD][FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme3]Erik: Even the air looks[N]warped. Everything is[N]shimmering.[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Will]Will: We should rest in[N]this village today.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'nvAC_bones'
nvAC_bones.dialogstring_088020! `[BOR:3][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme0]It still isn't[N]significantly weathered…[N]It seems like a recently[N]skeletonized corpse.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'nvAC_kara'
nvAC_kara.dialogstring_08826B! `[BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: It's a little[N]ominous, isn't it…?[FIN][CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]There isn't a single[N]person here but skeletons[N]are lying around…[FIN]Not to distract from that;[N]shall we enter a house and[N]take a look inside?[END]`

?INCLUDE 'nvAE_stone_girl1'
nvAE_stone_girl1.dialogstring_0892E4! `[DLG:3,15][SIZ:D,2][SFX:10]Statues of girls are[N]standing quietly.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'nvAD_kara'
nvAD_kara.dialogstring_088B32! `[BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: No one's here, huh…[N]I wonder if it's an[N]abandoned village…?[FIN][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme3]Erik: It's just right for[N]us, isn't it? We can rest[N]as much as we like.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'nvAD_erik'
nvAD_erik.dialogstring_088BD8! `[CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme3]Erik: I'm already[N]exhausted. I don't think[N]I'll wake up for a hundred[N]hours.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'nvAD_hamlet'
nvAD_hamlet.dialogstring_088C47! `[DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,1][SFX:10]Squee squee…[END]`

?INCLUDE 'nvAD_kara'
nvAD_kara.dialogstring_088B8B! `[CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: Let's rest here for[N]today.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'nvAC_kara'
nvAC_kara.dialogstring_0882C7! `[BOR:3][DLG:3,13][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme0]We were tired from the[N]journey, so the party fell[N]into a deep sleep…[FIN]And then, after a while…[END]`
nvAC_kara.dialogstring_08830F! `[BOR:3][DLG:3,13][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme0][DLY:2]Will: Mrrrm… Hamlet…?[N]Let me sleep a little[N]more…[FIN][BOR:7][DLG:3,13][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1][DLY:2][DLY:1]Kara: Ugh… Wait a second,[N]Will… Don't touch me in[N]weird places…[FIN][CLD][PAU:3C][BOR:7][DLG:3,15][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1][DLY:0]Kara: Huh…! Who…?[N]Who are you…?![END]`
nvAC_kara.dialogstring_08839D! `[CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Thought](Do they mean to eat[N]us[AD]?)[FIN][CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: Look at the[N]children. They're skin and[N]bones[AD][FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Will]Will: The slave boy in[N]Freejia said his homeland[N]was starving.[WAI][N]This must be the place.[FIN][CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: Then those bones we[N]found[AD][WAI][N]Could hunger have driven[N]them to eat the dead?[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme3]Erik: W-we're going to be[N]next[AD]![END]`
nvAC_kara.dialogstring_0887C6! `[BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1][DLY:2]Kara: Hamlet… Making[N]sad-looking eyes like[N]that…[FIN]Could it be that you're[N]parting with everyone[N]soon…?[END]`
nvAC_kara.dialogstring_088811! `[BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,1][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: Eeeeeeeeeeeeeek…!![FIN][DLY:0]Hamlet…! Hamlet…!![FIN][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,1][PRT:@RetranslationTheme0][DLY:0][DLY:1]Will: Hamlet… Why…?[END]`

?INCLUDE 'nvAC_hamlet'
nvAC_hamlet.dialogstring_08885C! `[BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme3]Erik: Waah… Hamlet… You[N]snuck ahead and died[N]before us…[FIN][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: Hamlet… Sob… Sob…[END]`
nvAC_hamlet.dialogstring_08890E! `[BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme0]Inside our heads, a voice[N]that I was familiar with[N]before began to speak to[N]us.[FIN][BOR:6][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2][DLY:0]Everyone, please listen.[N]Hamlet became food for the[N]villagers by her own[N]personal decision.[FIN][CLD][BOR:6][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2][DLY:0]One piglet acted to save[N]several villagers.[FIN][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme0][DLY:0]Will: Could you be my mom?[FIN][CLD][BOR:6][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2][DLY:0]Will… And everyone that's[N]come this far… Darkness[N]is approaching the world.[FIN]Now it's your turn to put[N]your powers together and[N]save this planet.[FIN]So Will, please collect[N]the Mystic Statue and[N]head to the Tower of Babel[END]`

?INCLUDE 'nvAC_staring_man'
nvAC_staring_man.dialogstring_088EDC! `[DLG:3,13][SIZ:D,3][SFX:10]The man is staring[N]motionlessly into your[N]eyes…[FIN]Stare back?[N][PAL:0] Yes[N] No`
nvAC_staring_man.dialogstring_088F15! `[CLR]It seems like man is[N]staring at himself within[N]your eyes…[FIN][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4]You couldn't understand[N]each other's language, but[N]you could feel the buds of[N]understanding sprout.[END]`
nvAC_staring_man.dialogstring_088F71! `[CLR]The man's face seems[N]lonely…[END]`

?INCLUDE 'nvAC_hand_man'
nvAC_hand_man.dialogstring_088CE0! `[DLG:3,15][SIZ:D,2][SFX:10]The man holds out a[N]trembling hand…[FIN][CLD][DLG:3,13][SIZ:D,3][SFX:10]Grasp his hand in return?[N][PAL:0] Yes[N] No`
nvAC_hand_man.dialogstring_088D1F! `[CLR][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4]You couldn't understand[N]each other, but you felt[N]that something seemed to[N]have been communicated.[END]`
nvAC_hand_man.dialogstring_088D54! `[CLR]The man's face seems[N]lonely…[END]`

?INCLUDE 'nvAC_dumpling_man'
nvAC_dumpling_man.dialogstring_088DDE! `[DLG:3,15][SIZ:D,2][SFX:10]The man holds out a tiny[N]piece of food…[FIN][CLD][DLG:3,13][SIZ:D,3][SFX:10]Try to eat it?[N] Yes[N] No`
nvAC_dumpling_man.dialogstring_088E0F! `[CLR]It seemed like it was made[N]of bugs and pressed into[N]the shape of a dumpling…[FIN][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4]It made you nauseated, but[N]you felt that something[N]seemed to have been[N]communicated.[END]`
nvAC_dumpling_man.dialogstring_088E72! `[DEF]The man makes a sad face[AD][END]`

?INCLUDE 'nvAC_map_kid'
nvAC_map_kid.dialogstring_088FE1! `[DLG:3,15][SIZ:D,2][SFX:10]The boy points to the[N]northeast…[FIN][CLD][DLG:3,13][SIZ:D,3][SFX:10]Try showing him your map?[N] Yes[N] No`
nvAC_map_kid.dialogstring_08901E! `[CLR]The boy drew a picture of[N]a Buddhist temple on the[N]map![FIN][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4]You don't understand his[N]language, but the boy[N]probably wants to go to[N]this Buddhist temple…[END]`
nvAC_map_kid.dialogstring_089078! `[CLR]The boy made a[N]lonely-seeming face…[END]`

?INCLUDE 'nvAC_beckon_kid'
nvAC_beckon_kid.dialogstring_089126! `[DLG:3,13][SIZ:D,3][SFX:10]The boy pulls on your[N]sleeve. He probably wants[N]to take you somewhere.[FIN]Go along?[N] Yes[N] No`
nvAC_beckon_kid.dialogstring_089178! `[DEF]The boy smiles and[N]beckons with his hand.[END]`
nvAC_beckon_kid.dialogstring_089190! `[CLR]The boy made a[N]lonely-seeming face…[END]`
nvAC_beckon_kid.dialogstring_0891A2! `[DEF]The boy stands before a[N]skeleton, tears filling[N]his eyes.[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Thought](Family? A friend?[N]There's no way to ask.)[END]`

?INCLUDE 'nvAC_hamlet'
nvAC_hamlet.dialogstring_0888AD! `[CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,1][PRT:@CastleV051Will][PAL:0]Squee squee[AD][FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Thought](I'll never hear that[N]sound again.)[FIN][CLD][DEF]Smoke from the cooking[N]fire drifts through[N]the village.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'nvAC_erik'
nvAC_erik.dialogstring_0885DC! `[BOR:3][DLG:3,F][SIZ:D,5][PRT:@RetranslationTheme3]Erik: When we found this[N]so-called cannibal tribe,[N]I had thought they must be[N]terrifying people to eat[N]other humans.[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme3]Even though they were of[N]the same tribe, they had[N]to eat their friends in[N]order to survive…[FIN]I guess that humans are[N]animals after all…[END]`

?INCLUDE 'nvAC_kara'
nvAC_kara.dialogstring_0884FB! `[CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: How could Hamlet[N]jump into the fire knowing[N]what would happen[AD]?[WAI][N]Hamlet[AD] You brave little[N]pig.[FIN][CLD][BOR:D][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme6]Neil: Kara[AD][WAI][N]About what I said in[N]the tunnel[AD][WAI][N]I'm sorry.[WAI][N]I didn't understand him.[END]`
